# CLAUDE.md is a symlink to AGENTS.md. Prettier refuses a symlink named on its
# command line, so nx format:check (which passes the changed files explicitly)
# would fail on every branch that touches it. AGENTS.md is formatted as usual.
/CLAUDE.md

# video/ is a standalone npm project (product videos) with its own package.json;
# it is no Nx project and stays out of `nx run-many`.
/video
